  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p data-start=&quot;116&quot; data-end=&quot;510&quot;&gt;The obscured/frosted glazing of the privacy screen shall be with obscure glass to a level equivalent to Pilkington Level 3 or above (or the nearest equivalent standard) and retained in perpetuity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;512&quot; data-end=&quot;623&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;512&quot; data-end=&quot;523&quot;&gt;REASON:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;In the interests of safeguarding the privacy and residential amenity of neighbouring occupiers.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed 1.8m high privacy screen, as detailed on drawing&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;2025/0014/0001 Rev B, shall be installed within 3 months of the date of this decision and retained thereafter, unless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\nREASON: In the interest of neighbouring residential amenity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;"
